Revision history for TPSGI

0.001 2026-10-23 TEODESIAN
    - Initial Release
    - Route by an OpenAPI 3 document: a router exports %openapi in place of
      @routes, and a router that still has @routes dies as it loads.
      Templates take {name} and a final {name+}, the most concrete template
      wins, and parameters are validated and coerced by JSON::Validator.
      A path with a method that it has no route for is a 405, not a 400.
